report:DeploymentContextSection rdfs:subClassOf obo:IAO_0000314 .
report:ReproducibilitySection rdfs:subClassOf obo:IAO_0000314 .
report:ModelCardReference rdfs:subClassOf obo:IAO_0000310 .

core:Artifact skos:relatedMatch obo:IAO_0000030 .

